				"Parallel Hatches more than a single recipe to be performed at once. The duration stays the same as processing a single recipe, but the EU/t, input quantities, and output quantities are all multiplied by &6up to&r the parallel amount."
				""
				"这意味着你需要能够处理额外的 EU/t 需求（和输出量），通常需要 2 个 4A 能量舱或 2 个 16A 能量舱。如果不足以支持全部并联请求，系统会尽其所能。"
				""
				"&6Not all multiblocks can accept Parallel Hatches&r, but if they can it is stated in the tooltip of the multiblock controller. Typically it is usually the Large Series, the Rotary Hearth Furnace, Bulk Blast Chiller, and Mega Alloy Blast Smelter, but there are a few others too."
